OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with warm sunny spells for
OL,6,Fmost, although isolated light showers
OL,7,Fmay develop during the middle of the
OL,8,Fday. Winds picking up in the
OL,9,Fafternoon, before easing by the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mainly dry night with the
OL,13,Fchance of some patchy light rain in
OL,14,Fthe north of the region by the
OL,15,Fmorning. Breezy at times especially
OL,16,Falong the coast.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FA cloudy and mainly dry day
OL,19,Fwith some sunny intervals in the east,
OL,20,Fturning cloudy overnight as a band of
OL,21,Frain moves east through the region.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
